* r1: [unit] m] Source aperture radius / half-width (m)
* r2: [unit] m] Sample aperture radius / half-width (m)
* L_coll: [unit] m] Collimation distance (m)
* L_det: [unit] m] Sample-to-detector distance (m)
* r_bs: [unit] m] Beamstop radius (m)
* 
* %Link 
* 
* %End 
